This page's purpose is to archive all old, unused or scrapped media from [[Dandy's World]]. Said media can be classified as concept art that looks different to the final product, removed features, early developmental images, and unused files in the game's code. This page features both unused/scrapped content and their current counterparts. This is mostly to inform people on the content that isn't in-game anymore; any content that never made it into the game is not canon to the lore, and any content which was removed from the game is also non-canon.

